<title>USA: LaCrosse, Wis., won by  Nike Sec..</title>
<headline>LaCrosse, Wis., won by  Nike Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Sec. said it won $5.305 million of LaCrosse, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.58 percent.</p>
</text>
